ck_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-14T14:49:37Z"},"body":"This PR patches [ `GL.getSource`](https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/blob/5cdadd65a5aed12f5d8fc2ef6debfe6336da8d4d/src/lib/libwebgl.js#L513-L518) to use a fast path when the string length is known, avoiding `UTF8ToString`, which is quite slow due to scanning for the null terminator.\r\n\r\nWith this change, `GL.getSource` time is cut almost by half, on my shader preloader screen it went from ~**14.8ms**~ **35ms** to **7.9ms**. It is especially helpful for uncached shaders compiled during gameplay. In my game, it reduces the overhead of `getSource` by 0.2–0.4ms\r\n\r\n**Before**\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a860943-7818-47bc-a4dc-7c6e011de655)\r\n\r\n**After**\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad94e1cc-09eb-466a-82ef-8f6be0a6698d)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Notes:** Added the patch to `--post-js` to avoid \r\n\r\n```\r\nTypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'unshift')\r\n    at addOnPostRun (index.js:8:15224)\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":7,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}